Subject: [PATCH 27/34] Add a measurement of the OSD frames

With -m the plugin logs the time from a key to the next OSD frame
drawn by VDR, and every 5 seconds statistics of the OSD frames
(regions, size, draw and flush time).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
